<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS5.SSS0.Px3" title="In 3.5 Experiment Details ‣ 3 Evaluating Leakage: Controlled Multi-Agent Setup ‣ The Sum Leaks More Than Its Parts: Compositional Privacy Risks and Mitigations in Multi-Agent Collaboration" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Experimental Protocol</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
