<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In 4 Experimental Results ‣ The Sum Leaks More Than Its Parts: Compositional Privacy Risks and Mitigations in Multi-Agent Collaboration" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Simple CoT baselines fail against adversarial queries.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4 Experimental Results ‣ The Sum Leaks More Than Its Parts: Compositional Privacy Risks and Mitigations in Multi-Agent Collaboration" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Theory-of-Mind (ToM) improves sensitive success but hurts benign utility.</span></a></li>
