<span id="S4.T2.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.14.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">CoT</span>
<span id="S4.T2.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.14.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">70.5</span>
